WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.236
You're almost done with the course. At this point, either the course is really working for you, or

2
00:00:05.236 --> 00:00:06.946
you're a glutton for punishment.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
If the course is working well for you, please take 15 seconds to leave a quick review.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Reviews give a huge boost to courses like this.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.596
They help other professionals decide whether the material is right for them, and they allow the

6
00:00:19.596 --> 00:00:20.951
course to reach more people.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Even a short review takes just a few seconds, and it genuinely helps support the course.

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.456
I read and respond to every review, and I use that input to refine the course and make it even more

9
00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:33.944
useful for future students.

10
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
So if you found the material helpful, I would really appreciate you taking a moment to just leave a brief review.

11
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
And if you haven't already, connect with me on LinkedIn.

12
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.820
When you finish the course or pass your exam, assuming you're studying for one, it would be great if

13
00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:54.941
you would tag me in your celebration post, so I can congratulate you on a job well done.

14
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.400
My profile link will appear on the screen, and there is also a clickable link to my LinkedIn profile

15
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.936
in the course resources.

16
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Or if you'd rather, you can jump directly to my LinkedIn page from my instructor page on Udemy.

17
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Thank you again for being a part of the course and for investing time to build your knowledge with me.

18
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Congratulations on getting near the end of the course. Now let's continue with the learning.

